  "synopsis": "Now that Koyomi Araragi and Hitagi Senjougahara have graduated, very few familiar faces remain at Naoetsu Private High School. One of these is Suruga Kanbaru, holder of the Monkey's Paw. When she begins to hear talk of a mysterious being known as the \"Devil\" who will magically solve any problem, Kanbaru immediately thinks these rumors are about her and decides to investigate.\n\nShe discovers the Devil is actually Rouka Numachi, a former basketball rival from junior high who is no longer able to play due to a leg injury. Rouka provides free advice to those who seek her out. Acting as a collector of misfortune, she enjoys relieving the stress of her clients by providing them with the false hope of having their problems solved. Although Kanbaru sees no real harm being done, she reprimands Rouka for lying and heads home, relieved she is not the cause of the rumors. But she may have a reason to worry after all: she finds that her left hand has reverted back to its human form.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]",
  "synopsis_es": "Ahora que Koyomi Araragi y Hitagi Senjougahara se graduaron, quedan muy pocas caras conocidas en la escuela secundaria privada Naoetsu. Uno de ellos es Suruga Kanbaru, poseedor de la Pata de Mono. Cuando comienza a escuchar hablar de un ser misterioso conocido como el \"Diablo\" que resolverá mágicamente cualquier problema, Kanbaru inmediatamente piensa que estos rumores son sobre ella y decide investigar.\n\nElla descubre que el Diablo es en realidad Rouka Numachi, una ex rival de baloncesto de la secundaria que ya no puede jugar debido a una lesión en la pierna. Rouka ofrece asesoramiento gratuito a quienes la buscan. Actuando como recolectora de desgracias, disfruta aliviando el estrés de sus clientes brindándoles la falsa esperanza de que sus problemas se resuelvan. Aunque Kanbaru no ve que se esté haciendo ningún daño real, reprende a Rouka por mentir y se dirige a casa, aliviada de no ser la causa de los rumores. Pero, después de todo, puede que tenga un motivo para preocuparse: descubre que su mano izquierda ha vuelto a su forma humana.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]",
